            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit if it is **patrolling the borders**, then pick an enemy unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up this unit more than 6&quot; from the target and more than 9&quot; from all other enemy units. Then, set up the units that were **patrolling the borders** with this unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
