            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick another friendly **^^Flesh-eater Courts^^** **^^Infantry^^** unit within this unit&apos;s combat range to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">1 model in the target unit is automatically slain. Then, until the start of your next turn, ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to each visible friendly **^^Flesh-eater Courts^^** unit in each phase while it is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic>
