            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, your opponent must pick 1 of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn:
***Drink Deep from the Chalice:*** Other than the **Companion** weapon ability, weapon abilities for attacks made by the target have no effect.
***Turn aside and Suffer the Consequences:*** Combat attacks that target that enemy unit score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.</characteristic>
