            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, while this unit is in combat with any enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^Beast^^** units, it has **^^Strike-first^^**. However, for the rest of the turn, while it is in combat with any enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^Beast^^** units, all of this unit&apos;s combat attacks must target an enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^Beast^^** unit.</characteristic>
